sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Level 3 programmatic checkout with the Intent API
  accDescr: Sequence diagram: Level 3 programmatic checkout with the Intent API. 6 participants: Consumer, Agent platform, Mastercard network, Merchant, Acquirer or PSP, and Issuer. 7 steps, 6 crossing a trust boundary, 3 failure branches. Based on mastercard-agent-pay Agent Pay developer guides (unversioned, read 2026-10-21) (2026-10-21). Step 1: Consumer to Agent platform: State purchase intent. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 2: Agent platform to Mastercard network: Register intent (Intent API). This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 3: Mastercard network to Agent platform: Return intentId and credentials. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 4: Agent platform to Merchant: Checkout via merchant API. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 5: Merchant to Merchant: Validate intent. If Total exceeds orderTotalAmount or srcDpaId differs: Reject the checkout. If SKU, quantity or address mismatch: Flag for review. If Deferred order fails validation: Ask the agent to obtain explicit consumer confirmation. Step 6: Merchant to Acquirer or PSP: Submit authorization. This step crosses a trust boundary. Step 7: Acquirer or PSP to Issuer: Authorize through network. This step crosses a trust boundary.
  autonumber
  participant p_consumer as Consumer
  participant p_agent as Agent platform
  participant p_network as Mastercard network
  participant p_merchant as Merchant
  participant p_acquirer as Acquirer or PSP
  participant p_issuer as Issuer
  p_consumer->>p_agent: State purchase intent
  Note over p_consumer,p_agent: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_agent->>p_network: Register intent (Intent API)
  Note over p_agent,p_network: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_network-->>p_agent: Return intentId and credentials
  Note over p_network,p_agent: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_agent->>p_merchant: Checkout via merchant API
  Note over p_agent,p_merchant: Crosses a trust boundary
  alt Expected path
    p_merchant->>p_merchant: Validate intent
  else Total exceeds orderTotalAmount or srcDpaId differs
    Note over p_merchant: Reject the checkout
  else SKU, quantity or address mismatch
    Note over p_merchant: Flag for review
  else Deferred order fails validation
    Note over p_merchant: Ask the agent to obtain explicit consumer confirmation
  end
  p_merchant->>p_acquirer: Submit authorization
  Note over p_merchant,p_acquirer: Crosses a trust boundary
  p_acquirer->>p_issuer: Authorize through network
  Note over p_acquirer,p_issuer: Crosses a trust boundary
